Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=8}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:54.51,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,{\an8}[KLAHADORE] Don't call\Nit murder, Jango.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't like the sound of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.14,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Oh, right, accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an accident...\Nthat you planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:04.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are those guys\Ntalking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:08.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we listen\Na little closer, we can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.57,0:02:10.49,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] We\Ncan't simply kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It is critical to our plan that\NMiss Kaya perishes in an unfortunate accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So don't screw that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So basically, on your signal,\Nthe men and I storm the village
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:24.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and manage to "accidentally" kill\Nthe little rich girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:27.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you get her inheritance\Nand we all get paid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:28.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ignorance is astounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:34.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not related, so how\Ncould I inherit anything from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.01,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] You'll work\Nvery hard to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.60,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE]\NNo Jango, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:41.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me, this is\Nthe most important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.64,0:02:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before you kill her, you'll use your\Nhypnosis to make Kaya write her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.06,0:02:50.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it will say, "I leave my entire\Nfortune to my butler, Klahadore".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Then, and only then, will I have\Nundisputed control of her enormous fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:03:00.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And no one will\Nsuspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:01.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:05.75,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KLAHADORE] I have spent three long years\Ngaining the trust of everyone around me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so that it would be\Nunsurprising for her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:11.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to leave the entirety\Nof her inheritance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:14.80,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Three years\Nas a butler for this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:19.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure had us scared\Nback then, Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:23.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, you suddenly said\Nyou were giving up life as a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In no time at all you set up\Nsomeone to be your double.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:30.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you let the world see\NCaptain Kuro get executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:45.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only now, do I understand that was\Njust the beginning of this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are the "Man\Nof a Thousand Plans."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never call me that again.\NI abandoned that name years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:56.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I now wish to obtain my wealth without attracting\Nthe attention of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm a pacifist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing] Some pacifist you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Murdering an entire family\Ndoesn't exactly qualify as peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I haven't murdered\Nan entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:13.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The father's death\Nwasn't planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.57,0:04:16.07,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Whatever you say,\Nit makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:19.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it's all the same to you,\Nhurry up and give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The crew is getting bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:24.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting in the waters\Nnear here for over a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:27.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the men are growing\Nmore anxious by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.46,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] This is horrible!\NThis is really horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:40.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:43.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it bad guy stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:46.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Weren't you listening\Nto any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:47.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guys aren't just\Nbad, they're evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:52.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro is known to be the most\Ndevious, scheming pirate around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:55.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And though he's known for his smarts,\Nhe's legendary for his brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:05:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Word had it that the Marines caught\Nand executed him three years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but Captain Kuro is alive and well,\Nposing as Klahadore the butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And he's had his diabolical sights set on\NKaya's fortune for the last three years!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:15.55,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] First, they'll attack\Nthe village, then they'll kill Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:17.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:22.89,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] This is bad!\NThis is seriously bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, get down!\NThey'll see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:31.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, bad guys! You better\Nstay away from that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:33.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:34.40,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot,\Nthey've spotted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:39.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Come on! Hurry up and hide before they\Ndecide you need a long slow death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:43.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well now, if it isn't Usopp,\Nthe mischievous town liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams] Oh, no!\NI'm spotted too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:50.62,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Did you...\Nhear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, nope. Nothing at all.\NI don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We didn't hear a peep.\NWe just got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so we didn't hear\Nanything about anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We heard it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:01.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KURO chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.72,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:09.56,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Pay attention, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And watch this ring closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:14.31,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hm? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it? It's\Nsome kind of weapon, we gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.69,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] By the count of "Jango,"\Nyou will be in a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:24.53,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)}One... Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:26.12,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Run for cover!\NHe's gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.07,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)}[JANGO] Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:31.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [USOPP whimpers] Heh?\N– [LUFFY snores]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:33.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [JANGO snoring]\N– Jango, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see you're still falling\Nasleep on the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.38,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,– [LUFFY snoring]\N– [USOPP] Hey, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:44.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He had to go and fall\Noff a cliff, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:52.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}A pity really, I didn't mean to kill him,\Nbut there's no way he could've survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:55.77,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] This can't\Nbe happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:57.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's really... dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:01.48,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] What\Nabout the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shall I take care of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:04.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything he could say\Nwould sound like, lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.62,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Jango,\Ntomorrow at daybreak,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the men are\Nto attack the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:16.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Rough up the villagers some and tear up\Ntheir homes a little, for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:20.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And above all, make sure\NMiss Kaya's death looks accidental.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:23.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:27.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just accept it, Usopp. There\Nis nothing you can say or do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to warn the villagers\Nof this impending tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps, screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:37.35,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Are you sure\Nabout that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:40.40,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Of course I am,\Nmy plans are flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.45,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:49.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!\NI gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:54.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Everyone in the village I grew up with is\Nin danger, and Kaya's gonna be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:58.87,Flashbacks-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:02.34,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I'm Usopp,\Nbrave warrior of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:05.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs] I heard you've\Nbeen a little down lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:08.01,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd tell you\Na story to cheer you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:09.89,Flashbacks-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] You would do well\Nto mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,982)}Please leave or I'll call\Nsomeone who will make you leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:18.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA laughs] And then?\NWhat happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:20.31,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)}[USOPP] I fought, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought Luffy was supposed\Nto be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:38.79,Main-207-,All,0,0,0,,[ALL] Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:40.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL yelp]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:42.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Luffy?\NIs he still at the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, he looked really upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why? Still mad\Nat the butler?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:54.10,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! That wasn't\Njust a mad face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That look was different!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:01.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was the tragic face\Nof sheer desperation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:03.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:04.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys show us the way\Nto get down to that shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:06.90,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] This smells\Nlike an adventure to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:09.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Something happened\Nat the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.36,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] I think this calls\Nfor the Usopp Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:14.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough already!\NHow do we get to this place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.45,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:23.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates! Pirates are coming!\NEverybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance!\NEverybody run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.72,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP] Tomorrow morning they're gonna\Nattack the village, we gotta get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:54.70,Main-207-,Villager D,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER D] Alright, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.70,0:09:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.20,Main-207-,Villager E,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER E] We\Ncan't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're putting a stop\Nto this here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.87,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] No! It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:03.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the truth\Nthis time! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! We all know\Nthat you're nothing but a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It would do you some good to follow\NKlahadore's example of hard work and honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:15.97,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Everything he could\Nsay would sound like lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:19.64,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:22.23,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what\NKlahadore's counting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:25.52,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He ignored me because he knew\Nno one would believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:34.11,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] Are these to your liking, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:38.49,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] Custom made\Nto your exact specifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:40.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was quite a trip\Nto get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:42.58,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] They're just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:47.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for traveling\Nso far to get them for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're a gift aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:56.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As of tomorrow, it will be\Nexactly three years to the day
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:01.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,since Klahadore arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's always taken\Nsuch good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.48,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] He'll be delighted\Nto receive such a lovely gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:08.02,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:12.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please hear me out, everyone!\NOur lives depend on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:13.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:15.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are gonna attack\Nthe village in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:17.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we believed every story\Nyou ever told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we would've run screaming from\Nthe village hundreds a times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:23.58,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Please, believe me!\NWe don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:26.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying\Nthis time. I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:29.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?!\NThey'll murder you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:32.21,Main-207-,Villager E,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER E] You'll be lucky\Nif we don't murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:37.76,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I'm not lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:40.05,Main-207-,Villager E,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER E] Get him!\NDon't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:54.40,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KURO] After three long years of absence,\NI made the call for my men, and you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your loyalty\Nwill be richly rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:12:01.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I intend on being more than generous\Nwhen I divide the take.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:05.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At dawn tomorrow, destroy the village\Nto your hearts content.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling, cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:13.92,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:16.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are going\Nto attack the village?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then they're gonna kill Kaya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:22.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep. That's what they said.\NNo question 'bout it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ALL yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:30.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what made you think\Nit'd be a good time for a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:35.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's the thing, I don't remember going\Nto sleep or getting down here at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This proves it!\NKlahadore is a bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:39.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp saw right through him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:42.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I bet he's on his way to warn the villagers\Nso they'll have time to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:44.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:47.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Those stupid pirates won't hurt anyone\Nbecause the town will be abandoned
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by the time they get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:49.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:52.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd better run away\Ntoo if we wanna live!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:53.67,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Alright, let's pack\Nour treasure and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:55.96,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Run like the wind! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:12:58.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:12:59.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:00.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:03.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to stock up\Nbefore the meat shop guy leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:07.18,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] C'mon, that's not\Nreally the issue at hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:35.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, good. I was worried\Nyou wouldn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quick! Run, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:39.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone's going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's tricked the entire village!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore's really a\Ndeadly pirate captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:53.56,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:55.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't one of my stories!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:57.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the truth! I heard\Nit with my own ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:02.24,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP] Klahadore is a pirate captain who\Nweaseled his way into your family's home
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:03.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so he could steal\Nyour fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:05.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's pretended to be\Nyour butler for three years
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so he can kill you\Nand inherit your money!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:11.16,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] What are\Nyou talking about, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His crew is gonna raid\Nthe village at dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:16.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and in the process,\Nyou're gonna get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:23.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore is a very bad man,\Nyour life is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.51,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] He did treat\Nyou harshly earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I understand that you're hurt,\Nbut lying like this, it's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:39.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please.\NI'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:44.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every... one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All those lies you told me.\NThey brought joy to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... this is\Njust vengeful poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, I'm not just trying\Nto get back at Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:05.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?\NIt's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.39,0:15:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, KAYA laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:10.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, is\Neverything okay up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:17.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:21.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:24.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of this village
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:24.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:28.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before that butler gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:41.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:45.26,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:54.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I promise this'll all make sense\Ntomorrow, but right now we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:55.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Please... Trust me.\N– [KAYA gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:58.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[slap]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:06.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave Miss Kaya alone,\Nyou maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:24.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:26.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't let that lunatic get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He broke in and tried\Nto kidnap the lady of the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:47.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.66,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why won't\Nanyone believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:17:01.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:07.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:11.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There, there, ma'am,\Neverything's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:30.45,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! How's it going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:37.16,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,– [CARROT] Hey, Captain!\N– [PEPPER] Look, he's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:40.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! You're alive again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:43.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! And I had\Na pretty good nap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was sleeping\Nthe whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:48.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain, we heard all about those\Npirates and their evil plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:52.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We'd better hurry and warn the people\Nin the village so they have time to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Warn the people...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:17:58.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:01.81,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:03.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We all know you're\Nnothing but a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:15.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously,\NI'm lying like usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That butler made\Nme so mad with what he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:20.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd get him back\Nand say that he was a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KIDS, USOPP laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:22.62,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Oh, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You put the straw hat\Nguy up to it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. Where ya goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.72,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Honestly,\Nyou've really disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:36.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even though that butler guy {\i1}is{\i0} a jerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:40.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought you were better\Nthan lying to hurt someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:44.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I admired you for being\Nsuch a kind-hearted person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:47.44,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] And to think, we\Nrespected you this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:48.32,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.03,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Yeah,\Nit's suppertime anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:51.57,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Wonder\Nwhat we're having.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, how come\Nyou lied to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:02.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because all I do is lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:07.96,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP] There's no way anybody was gonna\Nbelieve what I had to say. Why should they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because what you were telling\Nthem was the honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They are coming. And they're\Ngonna level this whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:16.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what\Nam I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:19.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll think I'm lying\Nif I try to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:23.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Everyone in the village thinks that tomorrow's\Njust gonna be another normal day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:27.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They think I'm lying and that's\Nall they need to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:30.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stop those pirates\Nat the beach tomorrow myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:34.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault\Nfor being such a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:40.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't care anymore if they drive me\Naway with brooms or shoot me in the arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:45.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's my home...\Nand I love everyone in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:56.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're a hell of a good guy, sending\Nyour cronies away and going into battle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:59.64,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Just so you know, I have dibs\Non all the pirate treasure, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, you want\Na little help or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna help me fight\Nall these pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:06.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:09.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you said there's\Na whole buncha bad guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:11.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you look scared out\Nof your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:14.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. For your information,\NI have nerves of steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:16.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly okay\Nwith tons of bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:19.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, you're looking\Nat the legendary Captain Usopp,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:21.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,brave warrior of the high seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Alright,\Nfine, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I be?!\NThey're Captain Kuro's men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:31.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys mean business!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't need pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you guys are sticking\Naround cause you pity me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:37.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,just leave! I don't need\Nyou laughin' at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not laughing at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:42.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're helping\Nbecause you are honorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really think\Nwe'd risk our lives out of pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw... You guys!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=9}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=46}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
